SUMMARY:Holiday Bazaar at Black Ankle Vineyards
DESCRIPTION:Black Ankle Vineyards’ 5th Annual Holiday Bazaar is a festive\, two-weekend holiday market featuring a variety of local artisans\, makers\, and small businesses. The event brings together a thoughtfully curated selection of vendors offering unique\, handmade\, and locally sourced gifts (plus we've got some excellent bakers joining us this year). Guests can browse one-of-a-kind treasures\, enjoy Black Ankle wines\, and experience the warmth of the holiday season in a cozy vineyard setting. The Holiday Bazaar celebrates local craftsmanship\, community\, and the joy of shopping small during the holiday season.
