BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventclassicfilmseries3athewitches199026103-20261112@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261112T180608Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261112
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261113
SUMMARY:CLASSIC FILM Series: The Witches (1990)
DESCRIPTION:A dark whimsical fantasy film that blends humor\, suspense\, and imaginative visual effects\, The Witches follows a young boy who discovers a secret conven of witches plotting to turn children into mice. After he is transformed himself\, he must rely on courage and cleverness to stop their sinister plan. Starring Anjelica Huston as the Grand High Witch\, alongside Mai Zetterling and Jasen Fisher\, this film is celebrated for its striking makeup effects\, eerie atmosphere\, and faithful yet inventive adaptation of Roald Dahl’s beloved story. The Witches has become a cult classic\, offering a uniquely spooky and entertaining experience for audiences of all ages. STARS: Anjelica Huston\, Jasen Fisher\, Rowan Atkinson\, Mai Zetterling RUNTIME: 90 minutes GENRE: Fantasy\, Horror\, Action\, Adventure RATING: PG This event is part of the Wonder Book Classic Film Series\, celebrating books and classic movies. The Weinberg Center\, located in the heart of Downtown Frederick\, MD\, offers a historic backdrop for a unique film experience.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/classic-film-series%3a-the-witches-(1990)/26103/
END:VEVENT
