SUMMARY:Medieval Knight Out
DESCRIPTION:Hear Ye! Hear Ye! You are hereby summoned for an enchanted evening within the realm. Enjoy a royal lineup of festivities\, including themed crafts\, a scavenger hunt quest\, foam axe throwing\, medieval trivia to test thy wisdom\, and more! Attire: Comfort is key as you will journey between indoor and outdoor lands. We encourage you to embrace the medieval theme however you see fit. Royal Decrees: • Light refreshments shall be served • An adult maiden must accompany her young lord • Advance registration is required\, as space in the kingdom is limited • $24 for each additional child
