SUMMARY:Photo pArtY!
DESCRIPTION:Party like it’s 1826 and celebrate the photographic arts! Join us for photo trivia\, funky/cool/niche gear show-and-tell\, print swapping\, photo book oohing and ahhing\, and more. Get to know other photographers\, share your work\, and check out the National Juried Photography Exhibition. Refreshments provided. Friday\, November 13 • 6–9 pm $15 ($12 members)
