END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventlastingimpressionsartisttalk26openingreception3anewworkbypamelabettsandhollybuehler26376-20261114@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261112T180608Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
SUMMARY:"Lasting Impressions" - Artist Talk & Opening Reception: New Work by Pamela Betts and Holly Buehler
DESCRIPTION:Saturday\, November 14th\, 3- 5 p.m. Casual Event. Light food\, wine\, and beverages will be served. This will be a fantastic artist talk! Come see their new work. It is wonderful!! Pamela Betts and Holly Buehler are nationally recognized plein air painters known for creating vibrant\, light-filled landscapes. Both artists specialize in capturing fleeting moments in nature and share a strong commitment to traditional outdoor painting. Betts brings a luminous Impressionist approach to her work\, using expressive brushwork to capture light and atmosphere. Her harmonious color palettes evoke the distinct feel of different times of day\, from crisp mornings to glowing dusk. Buehler focuses on strong composition and vivid color\, highlighting the patterns and forms found in nature. Her bold brushstrokes balance the quick spontaneity of outdoor painting with an impactful sense of place and design. Both artists are regular fixtures on the plein air circuit\, earning spots in prestigious regional juried competitions and exhibiting alongside other leading outdoor painters. Their ability to work quickly in changing weather conditions has brought them Quick Draw honors and local festival awards. Regional galleries and private collectors feature their pieces\, where buyers appreciate the authentic connection to each location. Light food\, wine\, and beverages will be served. We look forward to seeing you there! - Kim (Lockhouse Gallery)
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/lasting-impressions-artist-talk-%26-opening-reception%3a-new-work-by-pamela-betts-and-holly-buehler/26376/
END:VEVENT
