BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:httpswwwvisitfrederickorgeventhighlandcowfallluxepicnicexperience23578-20261114@visitfrederick
DTSTAMP:20261112T180608Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261114
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261115
SUMMARY:Highland Cow Fall Luxe Picnic Experience
DESCRIPTION:Eat Picnic Explore and Black Rock Farm invite you to a heartwarming afternoon of connection\, comfort\, and countryside charm — all wrapped in the golden glow of autumn. Picture this: Warm blankets. Crackling fires. The smell of cider in the air. Elegant picnic tables set with care. Laughter between new friends. The soft nudge of a Highland cow as you take a selfie. What Awaits You: What Makes This Experience Unique: A beautifully styled luxury fall picnic surrounded by the peaceful beauty of the farm Cozy charcuterie boards filled with handcrafted seasonal bites from Graze & Savor A s’mores and cider station to keep you warm and nostalgic Sweet\, slow moments brushing\, feeding\, and connecting with our gentle Highland cows A simple\, creative Highland cow craft to take a piece of the magic home Intentional space to slow down\, connect\, and savor the season This isn’t just a picnic — it’s a celebration of everything we love about fall: comfort\, community\, and the joy of being present. Tickets limited to ensure an intimate\, relaxed experience\, and advance tickets are required. This event is for adults and children ages 10 and up.
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/highland-cow-fall-luxe-picnic-experience/23578/
END:VEVENT
