DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261122
SUMMARY:Queeraoke
DESCRIPTION:Every Second Saturday come and sing your heart out in a safe space in Downtown Frederick! Queeraoke is a karaoke experience like you’ve never had before with your host Black-Eyed Suzy (they/them)\, rolling out games\, challenges\, and sing alongs to keep the vibes flowing. Enjoy the classy drinks from Tenth Ward\, our favorite ally business who knows Pride is 365 days in a year! Let’s support them as they support us in providing a safe space to gather in downtown Frederick. Visit Queeraoke.com to keep up with latest events!
URL:https://www.visitfrederick.org/event/queeraoke/25888/
END:VEVENT
